Z||000015||2xsess||11-30-2000||12:35 PM||||RE-up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> not this guy. Won't discuss the details of what I don't agree with here but I don't like the Army either.<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000016||Philphine||12-01-2000||02:19 AM||||i rented a uhaul truck and tow dolly to pick up a fiero 150 mls away. already has a hitch on it and they tell you what size truck you need to do it. if you're moving any furniture and are using one use the uhaul to tow the car. ||||reg||1
Z||000017||gkozlov||12-01-2000||07:08 AM||||Philphine<P>The Army is moving my furniture. So the car<BR>is my responsiblity.<P><BR>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign1_3.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://g.kozlov.tripod.com/gkozlov.htm" TARGET=_blank>GKozlovs Fiero Site</A><p>[This message has been edited by gkozlov (edited 12-01-2000).]||||reg||1
